{"id":"nea-index","url":"https://www.eveonline.com/zh/eve-academy","title":{"zh":"新伊甸学院：新手指南"},"lang":"zh","source":"新伊甸学院（EVE Online 官方）","license":"© Fenris Creations（CCP Games），版权归原作者","blocks":[{"t":"quote","zh":"开启 EVE Online 之路所需的一切"},{"t":"h2","zh":"迈向永恒的第一步"},{"t":"p","zh":"你好，飞行员，欢迎来到新伊甸学院。我是你的船载数字助理奥拉。在新伊甸的众多机遇中选择自己的道路是一项艰巨的任务，但你毕竟是一名克隆飞行员；你的未来不可估量，我在这里为你提供指导，帮助你踏上漫长的旅程。在你规划课程时，请允许我向你简要介绍基础知识："},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/39SyXK1q7qjglmE78pTyhI/8a138e5ccef8ead50d9037485383a6d2/Aura-Square_630x550.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"无限选择 - 你将从哪里开始？"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/41vhdlZQ5Q8Ct9K7QaItza/e04bd88c72eda430eab4d5e74437e884/explorer-thumb.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"探险家"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/7KToHGNWQyWMltsBOYkiAR/a89e2e1c1521e6da9c2d5e1d4e584e94/industrialist-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"工业家"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4Nl23v9ptGa51Lbg0kyqEw/f34d4dd1ee4a87986c8a1cf1a41df447/enforcer-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"执法者"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/31kK7l6haim8exFn1NWAQA/f65217d49ed7084a247ce6a5cca5eecb/sof-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"自由战士"},{"t":"h2","zh":"必读"},{"t":"p","zh":"新伊甸是一个充满无限可能的宇宙沙盒。在踏上这个广阔世界的旅程之前，强烈建议你先熟悉一下眼前的道路，你将指挥的舰船，以及对克隆飞行员来说至关重要的功能和经济 - 所有这些都可以在这里探索。"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/5HNgMfrGShB8dbd6U4J1NR/9e99ea50fbcc035fe89bc672ad41e1d6/capsuleer-academy.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"……因为你是不死之身"},{"t":"p","zh":"在 EVE Online 中，你是一名克隆飞行员，是少数通过技术获得不死之身的幸运而坚定的人之一。封闭在一个被称为太空舱的专用命令界面中，你和你的舰船作为一个整体运行；船体就是你的身体，监控无人机就是你的眼睛，电容就是你的心脏，武器就是你意志的表达。如果发生意外死亡，太空舱中内置的神经扫描阵列会以数字形式记录你的思想，并将其传输到遥远的克隆舱，让你一次又一次地重生 – 在开辟群星道路的过程中，你可以永远自由地追求每一个目标。"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1FUcdhYN3DqYLEssXU72zH/1703a41784de1c3ef5509861f6399472/eve-academy-alpha-omega-card.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"身份不同，生命不息"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4WMrwdwnYMCZRobRQKNtpx/e51c25f2a980f2b4e5441ae822bcc8d7/Starter-Space-Screenshot_NoCopy_1920x1080.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"Starter space"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/nvfy4kwVAAQA3voqrYbCR/14ad893b358964a44150fe6a017dac8e/Screenshot_NoCopy_3840x2160__1_.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"个性定制舰船涂装"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4xz4pbTVgO2QueHGUFec6B/7a64ebb03e04a773adf0fc2cfcd7ff6e/eve-online-excel-add-in.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"INFORMATION IS POWER - MICROSOFT EXCEL ADD-IN FOR EVE"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1jzm9mZGRVjFoTVIdBhv7h/3fb7830cee18271ff134f3190fbc7409/Corp-Project-Enhancement.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"Corporation Projects - Chart Your Corporation’s Course"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/2Fpkefw2QyyW72ruItlGPq/f7b11edeb889939eb1f001c60503de26/Screenshot_NoCopy_3840x2160.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"趣味横生且回报丰厚的游戏内活动"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1DZF4nilRGirwGNizvhjBH/3710aa453ad66c00bd27af7bea5bfa34/evermarks-lp__1_.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/3pJw96ivQP5vrnFd3p8KWw/b22317d9b31a613ba557ada3ce34b165/Industrialists-Shape-EVE.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"在新伊甸中找寻联盟和社区"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4hXvEhEnW1MeBIkj0m0VZ9/87b4c5f6528320a847eeecda390a9a48/Screenshot_NoCopy_1920x1080.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"创建你自己的军团"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/5dLy3WaidOV9CrIVyBq8rc/ee83a5a2a6592abf12d21117bfd104a3/omega-offer.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"创建小号，释放力量"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/54w9CO60bOTab2yldds8Iu/5cee97c153afce6de5bb0c8f0fc82f6c/Screen_NoCopy_3840x2160__1_.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"星币和伊甸币 – 你的太空货币"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1XiF8ilmlf0s8ZkMqNX8L2/a376bb4923ca4648e86e779ac912d9e0/get-started-in-eve-online-meta-image.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"每个人都从某处开始"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/66k0zC1CryDvJfBnbneh9h/37e5db7376c95d61f72726385f100372/magic14.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"魔法 14"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4Q9dFMkHcTIBhhESdznfxX/539f9780e592b7c1c0bc91f852103c40/sci-fi-game-5.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"驾驶你的舰船"},{"t":"p","zh":"正确驾驶无数的舰船需要扎实的知识和经验基础。在了解控制总览、应对威胁和培养本能之间，有效驾驶舰船需要练习，但收获巨大。"},{"t":"h2","zh":"新伊甸帝国"},{"t":"p","zh":"所有自由克隆飞行员都来自四大核心帝国——艾玛帝国、加达里合众国、盖伦特联邦和米玛塔尔共和国。这些伟大的国家是人类文明基础的彻底崩溃和再生的产物，每个国家都有自己独特的文化、民族、对彼此的态度、技术专长和偏好，以及对人类未来的理想。"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/3v26iE8hxpZZs10HjYEqWM/010ffb0ef40cb271b82b3567b8a99e9d/emp_minmatar.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/14clkrYMLYwb6HJY6FP6RX/f3fac6cbf6bdd56dc2b2b20549406dc9/emp_gallente.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1POAlfVPZ1qseaMLZQEBHY/2b7abb2ef68a84a039174a56ddffaf1f/emp_caldari.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/1jJ3VeF760aJzssHSJIBal/6fcba875810d376df1a82ba9c3ebf15c/emp_amarr.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"额外资源"},{"t":"p","zh":"如果你需要更多资源，那么这些资源应该可以物尽其用。"},{"t":"h3","zh":"官方资源"},{"t":"ul","zh":["<a href=\"https://forums.eveonline.com/\">官方论坛</a>","<a href=\"https://support.eveonline.com/hc/en-us\">官方帮助中心</a>","<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLQvKSs1k6DLPgbYDZDAPTV9kO6T9YHhKg\">官方教程视频</a>","<a href=\"https://universe.eveonline.com/\">EVE Online 的传说</a>","<a href=\"https://eveonline.com/discord\">官方意见</a>"],"d":[0,0,0,0,0]},{"t":"h3","zh":"社区资源"},{"t":"ul","zh":["<a href=\"https://wiki.eveuniversity.org/Main_Page\">社区维基 - EVE 大学</a>","<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLs3acGYgI1-u2U_Lo4bHCjphS8aGtplyJ\">玩家教程 - Quill18 新手教程</a>","<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BwCe_6spY2w\">总览</a>","<a href=\"https://evewho.com/\">EVE 有哪些人</a>","<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/evejobs/\">EVE 有哪些任务</a>","<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/directory/game/EVE%20Online\">EVE Twitch 目录</a>","<a href=\"https://cheatography.com/bahamut-zer0/cheat-sheets/eve-online-windows/\">EVE Online (Windows) 键盘快捷键</a>"],"d":[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]},{"t":"h3","zh":"玩家军团"},{"t":"p","zh":"有大量资源可以帮助你找到适合自己的玩家管理军团。在<a href=\"https://forums.eveonline.com/c/corporations-alliances/recruitment-center/63\">论坛军团招募中心</a>或<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/evejobs/\">/r/evejobs</a>查看军团招募广告。"},{"t":"p","zh":"你也可以直接联系任何军团或联盟，例如<a href=\"https://www.aideron.org/\">Aideron Robotics</a>、<a href=\"https://wiki.bravecollective.com/public/corps/brave-newbies-inc/how-to-apply\">Brave Newbies Inc</a>、<a href=\"https://wiki.eveuniversity.org/Applying_to_EVE_University\">EVE 大学</a>、<a href=\"https://www.karmafleet.org/\">Karmafleet</a>、<a href=\"https://www.pandemic-horde.org/\">Pandemic Horde</a>、<a href=\"https://everookies.com/\">EVE 新手网</a>、<a href=\"https://eve-linknet.com/\">EVE 链接网</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.signalcartel.org/join-us\">Signal Cartel</a>，所有这些都可以帮助你入门。"},{"t":"p","zh":"官方EVE意见也有一个<a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/940573867192221696/940928948391538708\">招募频道</a>，你可以在这里找到一个军团加入，因为和朋友一起玩 EVE 会更有趣。"}]}